10.4.1 Closed User Groups (CUGs) may be employed by railways as an additional security measure. Such facilities may be particularly important if public network access to the radio system is provided (eg to prevent members of the public calling drivers and drivers calling members of the public). (I)

10.4.2 Any implementation of CUGs must take account of requirements for interoperability. (M)", "truncated": false}]}
